# SecurEat Environment Variables
# ===============================
# This project uses the openFDA API which requires NO API keys for basic usage.
# The API is publicly accessible without authentication.

# Optional: OpenFDA API Key (for expanded rate limits)
# Get your free API key at: https://open.fda.gov/api-key/
# VITE_OPENFDA_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Note: The application works perfectly without an API key using public access.
